    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a &quot;Neo-2D Action Puzzle Game&quot; that places a 2D game on a 3D surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate your character skillfully and use four types of items to solve the map's tricks,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the stage exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the 2D map is connected three dimensionally, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you may not be able to go where you want to go or find an unexpected path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this way, it has become an action game with a feel like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The direction of gravity changes depending on the player's position on 2D, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and this is reflected in the entire 3D, so making this game a puzzle that tests the player's 3D sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a &quot;Neo-2D Action Puzzle Game&quot; that places a 2D game on a 3D surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate your character skillfully and use four types of items to solve the map's tricks,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the stage exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the 2D map is connected three dimensionally, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you may not be able to go where you want to go or find an unexpected path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this way, it has become an action game with a feel like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The direction of gravity changes depending on the player's position on 2D, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and this is reflected in the entire 3D, so making this game a puzzle that tests the player's 3D sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
